Extracting data from websites requires web scraping techniques which can be complex and require specific libraries. To compare the safety measures and policies of Delta Airlines and United Airlines, we can use an API that provides the relevant data. 
One such API is the Aviationstack API. It provides access to real-time global aviation data, including safety-related data such as incidents, accidents, and fatalities. 
Here's a sample C# code that uses the Aviationstack API to retrieve and compare the safety data of Delta Airlines and United Airlines:
```
using System;
using System.Net.Http;
using Newtonsoft.Json.Linq;
class Program
{
    static async System.Threading.Tasks.Task Main(string[] args)
    {
        // Set up the HttpClient and Aviationstack API key
        var client = new HttpClient();
        var apiKey = "YOUR_API_KEY_HERE";

        // Retrieve Delta Airlines safety data
        var deltaResponse = await client.GetAsync($"http://api.aviationstack.com/v1/safety?airline_name=Delta%20Air%20Lines&access_key={apiKey}");
        var deltaJson = await deltaResponse.Content.ReadAsStringAsync();
        var deltaData = JObject.Parse(deltaJson)["data"][0];
        var deltaIncidents = deltaData["incidents"].Value<int>();
        var deltaAccidents = deltaData["accidents"].Value<int>();
        var deltaFatalities = deltaData["fatalities"].Value<int>();

        // Retrieve United Airlines safety data
        var unitedResponse = await client.GetAsync($"http://api.aviationstack.com/v1/safety?airline_name=United%20Airlines&access_key={apiKey}");
        var unitedJson = await unitedResponse.Content.ReadAsStringAsync();
        var unitedData = JObject.Parse(unitedJson)["data"][0];
        var unitedIncidents = unitedData["incidents"].Value<int>();
        var unitedAccidents = unitedData["accidents"].Value<int>();
        var unitedFatalities = unitedData["fatalities"].Value<int>();

        // Display the safety data in a tabular format
        Console.WriteLine("Delta Airlines\tUnited Airlines");
        Console.WriteLine($"{deltaIncidents}\t\t{unitedIncidents}");
        Console.WriteLine($"{deltaAccidents}\t\t{unitedAccidents}");
        Console.WriteLine($"{deltaFatalities}\t\t{unitedFatalities}");
    }
}
```
Note that you will need to sign up for an Aviationstack API key and replace "YOUR_API_KEY_HERE" in the code with your actual API key.

